guide.skyresources.stage1.stage1.text:
Welcome to Sky Resources 3. The guide is split into progression stages. Use the left list and search box to find a page, then use the item buttons inside a page for recipes, related pages, or structure previews.

If void islands are enabled, use /island or /island create <type> to create a starter island. Pick the route that matches your start: {action:1} {action:2} {action:3} {action:4} {action:5}

JEI integration is expected for recipe lookups; the guide keeps the progression route readable when a recipe viewer is not available.
